hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"179","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Us ki bhalai mangta hun, us ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. [Hawa chale par padhe]"
"180","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Us ki bhalai, us mein jo bhalai aur jis ke sath bheji gae us ki bhalai mangta hun; us ke shar, us mein jo shar aur jis ke sath bheji gae us ke shar se teri panah chahta hun. [Hawa chale par padhe]"
